 is used also in Is. iv. 2. Jerem. xxiii. 5. xxxiii. 15. and in all those passages the Vulg. renders it by 'Germen.' In the passages of Zech. and, Jerem. the LXX. have the word ἀνατολή . The word in the original means 'a sprout' or 'shoot.'"},{"id":"c4ceb79317d0","b":"PSA","v":"lf.ambrosius.epistulae","w":"ambrosius.epistulae","a":"ambrosius_von_mailand","s":68,"p":[33,33],"r":[23,5],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"1 Sobrietatis inebrietas. Ps. xxiii. 5. Vulg."},{"id":"d1342c5fc422","b":"MIC","v":"lf.ambrosius.epistulae","w":"ambrosius.epistulae","a":"ambrosius_von_mailand","s":75,"p":[18,18],"r":[5,1],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"1 a diebus saeculi. Mic. v. 2.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"fc03659752fd","b":"MIC","v":"lf.ambrosius.epistulae","w":"ambrosius.epistulae","a":"ambrosius_von_mailand","s":75,"p":[18,18],"r":[5,2],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"2 Saeculum. Mic. v. 3.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"7da18bb69e74","b":"1TI","v":"lf.ambrosius.epistulae","w":"ambrosius.epistulae","a":"ambrosius_von_mailand","s":75,"p":[27,27],"r":[3,13],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"f i.e. the priesthood, cf. 1 Tim. iii. 13."}]}
